# CI/CD Workflow Conventions

## Workflows

| File | Trigger | Purpose |
|------|---------|---------|
| `test-build-deploy.yml` | Push/PR to `main`, `src/**`, `e2e/**`, and related config | `npm ci`, unit tests, build, Playwright e2e; SSH deploy on push to `main` |

## CI requirements

- Node.js 20; npm with frozen lockfile (`npm ci`)
- Must pass: unit tests (`npm run test:run`), production build, e2e (`npm run test:e2e`)
- Build / e2e use `VITE_API_URL` / `E2E_API_URL=https://api.retentio.app:8443`
- E2E secrets: `E2E_USERNAME`, `E2E_PASSWORD`

## Rules

- Do not skip CI checks or add `[skip ci]` without team agreement
- New features should include Vitest coverage in `src/**/*.test.{ts,tsx}` where unit-testable
- User-flow regressions belong in `e2e/`
- Deploy job runs only on push to `main` after the test job succeeds
